WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
He had his sights set on my grandfather back then.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Just changed from a prostitute to grandma Gu

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:06,200
Don't take one bite at a time and that's what?

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,400
People talk every day

5
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:08,600
How many taels are you giving us?

6
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,000
You jumped out on your own

7
00:00:10,690 --> 00:00:12,490
Then bring Gu Shiyi to Baijing City

8
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:14,690
Let me see otherwise

9
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:17,890
I say it every day, every month, all over the city

10
00:00:17,890 --> 00:00:18,890
Okay, okay, okay

11
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:20,490
Little Ancestor, stop reading.

12
00:00:20,490 --> 00:00:21,890
I think of a way

13
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:24,690
I can't think of a way, dad?

14
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:26,090
This is what you said

15
00:00:26,090 --> 00:00:31,860
Don't regret it, eh

16
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:38,340
So good looking Shadow Patriarch

17
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:42,940
I want this Gu Shiyi to remember all the details.

18
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:52,920
is all is

19
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,120
It will be warm in a while
